# API Attack Surface

The attack surface includes every publicly or internally accessible API component.

```
Internet
    │
    ▼
API Gateway
    │
 ┌──┴────────────┐
 ▼               ▼
Public APIs   Internal APIs
      │             │
      ▼             ▼
